  "title": "The Wedding Plus-One",
  "subtitle": "\"I had seven weddings in a summer. My ex was at three. My neighbor agreed to be my fake boyfriend over rosé on the fire escape.\"",
  "penName": "Darcy Maren",
  "genre": "fakeDating",
  "hook": "Seven weddings in fourteen weeks. My ex was invited to three of them because he was somebody's brother, somebody's roommate, and somebody's groomsman. My roommate said I needed a fake boyfriend. My bank account said I needed to cancel cable. My new neighbor (who had moved in six days earlier, who had twice complained about my music, who was a war-zone journalist taking a forced sabbatical, who was thirty-six and grumpy and had forearms) agreed on the fire escape with a bottle of cheap rosé. He said: \"I'll do it if you stop playing Harry Styles at 2 a.m.\"",
